# Production runtime configuration is Secret Manager-only. Do not place the
# legacy server API key or Telegram values in dotenv files.
#
# Provision with non-echoing prompts from the firebase-leads directory:
#   firebase functions:secrets:set LEGACY_FIREBASE_API_KEY
#   firebase functions:secrets:set TELEGRAM_BOT_TOKEN
#   firebase functions:secrets:set TELEGRAM_CHAT_ID
